\section{\alg}

In this section, we aim to develop a novel video LLM that aligns well with video structures, addressing two questions: (1) how to model {the structured video LLM outputs that are align well with video structures}, and (2) how to implement theoretical models. We start by proposing \emph{\framework} framework to tackle "how to model". Then, we introduce \alg to address "how to implement".
We have included a detailed discussion about our framework in Appendix~\ref{sec:discussion}.
