\paragraph{Pose initialization.} Initialization is crucial in optimization problems. 
Unlike previous fitting methods that heavily rely on initializations from learned generalized regressors, we leverage PointDiT to sample plausible initial body poses.
We also show that our model is compatible out-of-the-box with most existing 3D pose regressors. 
For a comprehensive evaluation and discussion, please see~\cref{sec:compare_all}.


