    u = \left( \sin(\theta)\cos(\phi), \ \sin(\phi), \ \cos(\theta)\cos(\phi) \right)
\end{equation}
where $\theta \in [-\pi, \pi]$ and $\phi \in [-\frac{\pi}{2}, \frac{\pi}{2}]$.
