\textbf{Text encoder.}
Given a batch of text inputs, we utilize the pre-trained text encoder to extract text tokens $T \in \mathbb{R}^{B_q \times L_q \times d_{q}}$, where $B_q$, $L_q$ and $d_q$ denote the number of text queries, the number of words per query, and the dimension of query representation, respectively.
