\section{Methodology: 3D-GSRD}
In this section, we present our method \textbf{3D} Molecular \textbf{G}raph Auto-Encoder with \textbf{S}elective \textbf{R}e-mask \textbf{D}ecoding (\textbf{3D-GSRD}) (Figure~\ref{fig:masked_graph_modeling}). Below, we start by elaborating on the Selective Re-mask Decoding and the pretraining objective of 3D-GSRD. We then describe the encoder of 3D-ReTrans.


