The proposed emotion embedding network is trained on two NVIDIA A800 GPUs using the aforementioned dataset. We employ the AdamW~\cite{loshchilov2017decoupled} optimizer with a weight decay of 1e-5 and a learning rate of 1e-3. The training process spans 200 epochs with a batch size of 768, completing in approximately 7 to 8 hours.

