$\mathbf{T}_i=[\mathbf{w}_i^0; \mathbf{w}_i^1; \cdots; \mathbf{w}_i^m] \in \mathbb{R}^{(m+1)\times C}$ be a collection of $m$ word embeddings  ($\mathbf{w}_i^j$) and the \texttt{[CLS]} token (denoted as $\mathbf{w}_i^0$), where $C$ is the number of channels in the embedding space. 
