We obtain the \emph{global} %To achieve a 
video-level representation by averaging all frame embeddings in $\mathbf{V}_i$ using mean pooling: $\mathbf{v}_i = \frac{1}{n}\sum_{j=1}^n  \mathbf{f}_i^j$. 
