The temperature parameter  $\tau$ controls the aggregation process, where smaller $\tau$ incorporates more textual information.

The goal of the fine-grained matching is to pull a 
%The next step involves pulling 
frame visual feature $\mathbf{f} \in \mathbf{V}_i$ closer to 
the frame-aware AD representations $\tilde{\mathbf{t}} \in \tilde{\mathbf{T}}_i$ 
